    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰρέτρ-α</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰρέτρ-η</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quiver</i> for arrows, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰοδόκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.443
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς εἴ τε φαρέτρῃ πῶμ᾽ ἐπιθείη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.314
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφηρεφής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλη ἔνδον ἐντὶ φαρέτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					2.84
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				979
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				969
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐκ φαρέτρας ῥηματίσκια . .
					ἀνασπῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					180a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τοξευμάτων</span>
			<i>a</i>
			
			<i>quiver-full of . . ,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(5).647.28
			</span></i> (Coressus, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
